(
    title: "Frostbite",
    developer: Some("Steve Cartwright"),
    description: Some("Frostbite Bailey leaps across four rows of drifting ice floes, stamping each white floe — it flips to blue — to haul back another block and raise his igloo before the temperature gauge ticks down to nothing. Killer clams, snow geese, king crabs and a prowling polar bear all want him in the water; grab a passing fish for bonus points, then dive into the finished igloo to bank the leftover warmth."),
